+# Checklist: create-and-scene
+
+Merged against the approved proposal, design, canonical specs, and test plan.
+ES = `specs/evolving-scene-presentations/spec.md`; PS = `specs/presentation-skill/spec.md`;
+PV = `specs/presentation-verification/spec.md`. References below are relative to this change.
+
+Original lead (`L-*`) and implementor (`I-*`) IDs are retained. An ID may recur when its
+original row covered distinct behaviors now checked separately. Source identifies the
+origin of the behavior; `crosscheck` identifies definition coverage missing from both inputs.
+Combined checks retain the stricter obligations. These are planned checks, not claims of
+execution or verification. Inspection means inspection of files, code, or test assertions;
+no row requires an agent to operate the product. Only the four integration/end-to-end
+tests named in `test-plan.md` are planned.
